# The Cast-Iron Pan: Thanksgiving's Golem kind. A round, heavy black skillet
# standing on its edge, two glowing eyes and a grim mouth in its iron face,
# its long handle sticking out to the left from the top of its head, at a
# slight upward angle, and
# short orange legs. No helmet (map m3). Empty columns on the right balance
# the handle, so the pan itself stays centred on its spot.
